# Lane-local vector add immediate kernel.
# Host uploads 4 words, preloads memory word 0 with input for every lane,
# initializes word 1 to a known sentinel, and sets the execution mask.
# On completion, active lanes have memory[1] = memory[0] + 7 mod 2^32.
LOAD r3, [r0 + 0]
ADDI r4, r3, 7
STORE r4, [r0 + 1]
LOAD r5, [r0 + 1]
